WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.980
Akane Park

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.600
So many fond memories here.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:23.960
Yeah.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.940
I can't remember a time when
I've enjoyed myself more.

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:32.720
We'd have fun together, playing soccer until
we got all covered in dirt and the sun had set.

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:36.000
I used to wish I'd been born a boy.

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:40.140
I hit you with my elbow that day.

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:44.440
I was so stupid.

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:46.980
I can't believe I told you to date some other guy.

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:50.110
Something was wrong with me. I'm sorry!

00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:55.220
You won't ever leave me alone again, right?

00:00:55.220 --> 00:00:57.120
Never ever. Promise.

00:00:57.820 --> 00:00:58.880
Really?

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:00.200
Really really.

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:02.200
I'm so happy!

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:43.320
<i>After that night, the two of us
went back to how we once were.</i>

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:47.080
I love this so much!

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:48.000
I know.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.310
You always did.

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:52.310
You're not going to fit.

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:53.780
How would <i>you</i> know?

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:54.820
Mmph!

00:02:56.470 --> 00:02:58.220
Hey, hey, Maeda-kun.

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:00.490
Try giving my butt a shove.

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:02.420
<i>Shove your butt?!</i>

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:04.540
<i>Are you sure I should?</i>

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:06.960
<i>But no matter how I do it, I'll...</i>

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:09.340
Hey, Maeda-kun, give it a shove!

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:10.740
I'm almost there!

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:14.340
You won't fit.

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:16.640
I guess so.

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:24.840
You're totally into it.

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:26.040
I guess.

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:30.820
I'm still only a beginner at photography, but I feel like it suits me.

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:32.320
Oh?

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:35.120
I can't say that I've got what it takes to become a pro,

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:37.910
but I want to keep doing this as a hobby at least.

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:39.030
That's nice.

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:42.110
I'm envious that you have something you're keen on.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:45.720
Don't you like tennis though, Niimi-san?

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:49.420
Kind of, but I guess I'm not as enthusiastic as you are.

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:50.660
I wouldn't say that.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:54.040
What's more, I made everyone so worried.

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:57.920
Let's go apologize to them together.

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:58.630
Okay.

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:01.260
Niimi-san.

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:04.680
Could you come see my photos?

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:05.640
Huh?

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:10.040
They host this photography exhibit at the school festival every year.

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:14.440
I'm thinking of displaying my best photos at the event.

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:15.650
So...

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:16.770
I'll go!

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:18.150
I'll definitely go!

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:20.400
I'd love to see your photos.

00:04:21.430 --> 00:04:22.580
Thanks.

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:27.490
Your dreams are my dreams.

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:41.460
<i>I got a natural shot of her.</i>

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:43.960
I managed to capture her heart.

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:48.940
Geez, I wasn't expecting that.

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:50.060
<i>This...</i>

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:53.020
<i>This is the essence of photography!</i>

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:02.360
Niiyan!

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:04.320
Oh, you haven't gotten dressed yet?

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:06.660
Don't you have a date with Haru-chan?

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.490
It's not a date.

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:09.900
Plus, I still have time—

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:11.790
It's a crime to be late for a date.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.440
I told you, it's not a date—

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:16.790
This horoscope site says you'll be luckier if you give yourself plenty of time!

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:21.050
Stop making excuses and get changed right now.

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:24.920
It also says to beware of merry neighbors.

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:26.180
What's that supposed to mean?

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:30.430
Akane Park

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:30.430
Well, thanks for the tip anyway.

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:33.350
Sorry I made you wait!

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:37.320
I know it's a crime to be late.

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:39.980
Don't worry.

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:42.320
I'm the one who got here way too early.

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:45.020
I've been so excited since this morning.

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:48.110
Could I take some photos of you in your casual clothes?

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:50.450
Sure.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:54.580
Man, perfect day for low-angles.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:57.080
Man, perfect day for high-angles.

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:57.750
Huh?

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:01.000
Looks like things went well for him.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:03.060
Ugh, that bastard!

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:06.130
Hey, count us in!

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:08.820
We aren't gonna let you keep the
Photography Club Jewel all to yourself!

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:11.140
It's pretty rare to see you in your casual clothes!

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.140
Haruka-tan!

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:14.100
Crap!

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:15.640
Was this what the horoscope meant?!

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:17.230
Get the hell outta the way, Maeda!

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:19.100
Accentuate your chest, Haruka-tan!

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:21.500
Stop that! Go find other girls—

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:23.440
I know! Take some of Uchida instead!

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:25.610
Isn't she the lone female of the Photography Club?

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:29.200
Huh? How can we do that when she's not even here?

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.450
Since when...

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:36.450
Did we get in the way of your stealth photography?

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:38.160
Uchida in her casual clothes, huh?

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:39.210
Can't say I'm interested.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:41.540
Such variance in skill.

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:46.090
Maeda, please let us in on this!

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:47.090
We're begging you!

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:49.090
Huh? Where'd they go?

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:02.610
Don't stare at me so much. It's embarrassing.

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:04.320
Sorry.

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:05.300
But...

00:07:05.930 --> 00:07:09.490
The beach is awesome!

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:12.780
What was that about?

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:16.640
I just put my honest feelings into words.

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:19.410
It's awesome how I'm at the beach with you.

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:20.460
I feel the same way.

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:22.790
I'm really happy to be here with you!

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:36.560
Strike some sort of pose.

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:39.230
You're taking photos now?

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:47.230
Like this?

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:50.610
Nice. Just perfect.

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:07.500
Hey, wanna play some beach soccer?

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:09.630
Soccer...

00:08:09.970 --> 00:08:14.140
Loser buys the winner ice cream or shaved ice!

00:08:14.850 --> 00:08:15.510
Here I come!

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:36.900
Yay!

00:08:37.730 --> 00:08:39.540
You're treating me to ice cream!

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:43.000
Wait, I kinda want shaved ice too.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:46.020
Maeda-kun?

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:47.840
Let's stop this.

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:49.340
Soccer's no good.

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:51.590
Why not?

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:53.880
Just because.

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:00.140
Come with me.

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:06.300
Why are you suddenly all...

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:09.320
You're still worried about what happened that day?

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:12.900
No, that's not it.

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:15.950
I just couldn't move.

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:21.700
We're not kids anymore, and I
couldn't help noticing certain things.

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:23.410
Maeda-kun.

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:29.080
H-Hey, what are you doing?!

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:32.920
I can touch you like this.

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:35.090
I can cling to you like this.

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:39.360
But why?

00:09:41.070 --> 00:09:44.480
You're treating me way too preciously.

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:56.570
Touch me.

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:01.120
Touch my chest.

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:03.740
A-Are you out of your mind?!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:08.970
Even if you touch me there, I won't feel repulsed at all.

00:10:08.970 --> 00:10:11.620
In fact, I <i>want</i> you to touch me.

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:16.260
I want you to know that I'm no different on the inside compared to when I was a kid!

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:18.510
Please, touch me!

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:22.260
Are you sure?

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:24.220
Do you need to ask?

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:25.850
Of course I'm sure.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:41.820
S-Sorry.

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:43.280
Was I too rough?

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:47.790
No, that was fine.

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:29.620
Hello?

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:34.130
Sorry for calling so late.

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:35.680
You're still awake?

00:11:35.680 --> 00:11:36.820
Yeah, I am.

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:37.670
What's up?

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:41.480
Well, you see...

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:46.430
I couldn't fall asleep because I can't stop thinking about you.

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:51.980
Whenever I closed my eyes, I'd see your face.

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:54.400
I'd remember your voice.

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:58.320
So I thought that maybe I'd be able to fall asleep once I've heard your voice.

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:00.000
I see.

00:12:00.590 --> 00:12:02.740
Feel free to use my voice anytime.

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:06.740
Thanks.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:13.290
The Day of the School Festival

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:15.460
<i>The sky, no different from the start of the term.</i>

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:19.960
<i>Fearing failure, I had lived unchanging days up until now.</i>

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:22.800
<i>But those days will persist no longer.</i>

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:27.810
<i>My destiny has been greatly changed since I encountered photography.</i>

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:31.020
<i>I've become so proactive that I scare even myself.</i>

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:34.940
<i>I'm grateful to photography for
bringing about this change in me.</i>

00:12:36.310 --> 00:12:39.690
<i>All that's left is to convey my feelings today.</i>

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:43.200
<i>Every photo displayed at the school festival photography exhibit</i>

00:12:44.010 --> 00:12:47.200
<i>was captured with everything that I had to give.</i>

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:52.410
I'm not sure I want to go in.

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:55.120
Don't worry. Just go.

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:57.790
Welcome to our photography exhibit.

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:00.090
H-Hello.

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:05.340
We shall now announce the winner of this year's Miss Photogenic Contest!

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:08.140
Miss Photogenic?

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:13.180
You were chosen by our glorious Photography Club as this year's Miss Photogenic.

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:14.100
Huh?

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:15.980
Unveil the theme photograph!

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:22.690
This was when...

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:25.220
Sorry I didn't tell you beforehand.

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:27.880
But it's a good photo, right?

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:30.280
"Wish", huh?

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:32.040
It's a nice title.

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:33.450
Thanks.

00:13:33.970 --> 00:13:36.960
But it's kinda embarrassing to see such a big photo of me.

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:38.580
Unveil <i>all</i> the photographs!

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:41.380
Huh?!

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:43.800
They're all photos of me?!

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:47.430
Photography Club Exhibit

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:47.430
Return Utensils Here

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:45.760
Well, there's a reason for this.

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:47.430
Allow me to explain.

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:48.930
Niimi Haruka-kun.

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.680
Y-Yes?

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.680
Photo
Club
Gallery

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:55.430
We did all we could to capture
every ounce of your beauty.

00:13:56.770 --> 00:14:00.440
However, it <i>is</i> true that these
photographs were taken in secret.

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:05.860
We understand if you do not want them exhibited and wish to decline the title of Miss Photogenic.

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:10.950
It would simply mean that our skills and passion for photography are not yet up to par.

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:16.830
But perhaps you can accept our good will.

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:15.450
Return Utensils Here

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:30.220
Return Utensils Here

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.960
Thank you. We are truly grateful.

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:27.170
Right on! Totally awesome!

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.760
Thank you very much.

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:30.220
Gratitude.

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:35.850
Chi, chi, chi

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:40.270
Moon Witch Pretty Rabbie

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:41.730
Feeling perky

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:43.320
Feeling excited

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:46.240
Something beside me makes me feel that way

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:48.780
Just like how the Moon

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:51.620
Keeps circling around the Earth

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:54.580
Caught by the sorrowful darkness

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:57.700
That chains down your heart

00:14:57.700 --> 00:15:01.000
We'll face it down and fight it

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:03.320
<i>And so, our school festival ended.</i>

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:07.420
There he is!

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:08.720
Looking good as always!

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:12.430
You really love that bear, huh?

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:13.470
Yeah.

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:17.770
He watched over us every day, you know.

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:20.560
So I come by to see him every once in a while.

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:21.650
I see.

00:15:22.390 --> 00:15:23.770
And...

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:24.730
And what?

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:28.110
Isn't there something you want to <i>bear</i>-eak to me?

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:31.240
Rawr!

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.410
You really haven't changed at all!

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:37.240
It crosses my mind all the time.

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:40.330
You look a lot different from when you were a kid.

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:43.570
You're... much girlier now.

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:45.840
But you're no different on the inside.

00:15:47.890 --> 00:15:51.010
I worked pretty hard to get that way, you know.

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:56.930
The breeze feels so nice.

00:15:56.930 --> 00:15:58.890
Fall really has fallen.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:04.020
The summer seemed to pass by in a flash.

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:06.040
So much has happened,

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:08.980
and I started talking to you again.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:12.240
It passed by in a flash for me too.

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:15.120
I started hanging out with you again

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:18.460
and talking to you like I used to.

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:28.750
Thinking back, ever since we were little...

00:16:35.030 --> 00:16:36.820
Niimi-san, I...

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:39.350
Niimi-san, I've...

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:40.770
I have always loved you!

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:41.700
Huh?

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:43.440
I love you.

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:44.390
I love you!

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:45.060
I really love you!

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:48.650
I've loved you ever since we were kids!

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:55.240
I'm so happy.

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:59.160
Maeda-kun, me too.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:00.620
I love you.

00:17:01.050 --> 00:17:05.620
Even back when we were kids, I've always loved you.

00:17:06.010 --> 00:17:07.180
Finally...

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:10.880
My feelings finally came through!

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:17.190
Sorry you had to wait so long.

00:17:17.190 --> 00:17:18.640
You'd better be!

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:21.920
You left me all alone! I was so sad!

00:17:22.530 --> 00:17:24.390
But that doesn't matter anymore.

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:27.310
You told me that you love me,

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:29.620
and I was able to tell you that I love you.

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:35.030
I was so stupid.

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:37.570
I didn't have confidence in myself.

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:38.570
But, Haruka...

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:41.620
Can I kiss you?

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:45.120
Once again, I swear...

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:47.370
that I'll never, ever let you go again.

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:50.710
Yeah.

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:52.250
I swear too.

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:53.550
I'll stay with you for—

00:18:06.490 --> 00:18:07.660
I love you.

00:18:17.670 --> 00:18:20.620
Come outta there, Haru!

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:22.580
The sun's setting.

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:24.660
I don't wanna.

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:26.040
I'm not coming out!

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:31.040
You're popular and have lots
of friends, so you don't get it.

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:34.630
You don't understand what it's like to be left out!

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:35.960
Haru...

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:40.300
If you stay with me, you'll get left out too!

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:42.930
Just leave me alone!

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:45.390
Don't say that, Haru.

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:49.310
I'll stay with you even if all my friends leave me.

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:51.810
Why?

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:57.490
Huh? Isn't it obvious?

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:05.990
I like you. That's why.

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:08.660
Huh? What'd you say?

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:10.000
I can't hear you!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.880
Ahh, geez!

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:14.380
I like you! That's why!

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:20.780
I like you! I really like you!

00:19:28.490 --> 00:19:31.560
You like me?

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:35.150
Yeah, I do.

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:36.360
I really like you!

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:38.610
Really?

00:19:39.540 --> 00:19:40.400
Really.

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:42.860
Really really?

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:44.320
Really really!

00:19:47.190 --> 00:19:48.330
I'm so happy!

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:51.160
So we liked each other!

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:52.170
Huh?

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:54.860
You know, I'm sure of it now!

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:56.640
I like you too!

00:19:56.640 --> 00:19:59.170
You're so cool and nice!

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:01.510
R-Really?

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:03.680
Thank you.

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:07.640
You should try acting girlier.

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:09.720
Like, wearing skirts and growing out your hair.

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:11.390
Huh? Girlier?

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:12.390
Yeah, yeah!

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:16.060
If you do, you'll have tons of girl friends!

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:18.320
I mean, you're great and fun to be with.

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:20.490
You'll never be left out!

00:20:21.170 --> 00:20:22.700
You think so?

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:25.320
You're cute, so I'm sure you'll be fine!

00:20:26.340 --> 00:20:27.830
I'm cute?

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:30.330
Yeah, I think you're cute!

00:20:30.840 --> 00:20:34.210
I've never been told that before.

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:37.840
'Cause you look like a boy at first glance.

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:41.210
If I wear a skirt, will I be even cuter?

00:20:41.210 --> 00:20:44.590
Will I be even cuter with long hair?

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:46.970
Yeah, I'm sure of it.

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:48.720
Then, then...

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:50.770
If I get really cute...

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:56.560
If I get really cute, will you marry me?

00:20:57.810 --> 00:20:59.940
I'll try really hard!

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:02.940
I'll try really hard to be girlier!

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:09.330
Marry me if I get really cute, okay?

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:11.340
Okay.

00:21:11.340 --> 00:21:13.120
I'll marry you.

00:21:13.590 --> 00:21:16.080
But only if you get really cute!

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:16.940
Yeah!

00:21:17.770 --> 00:21:19.240
All right!

00:21:19.240 --> 00:21:24.130
I'm definitely gonna get really cute!

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:34.860
Do you remember the first person who told you that they liked you?

00:21:35.670 --> 00:21:38.300
When I was all alone,

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:40.860
he chose me over everyone else

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:42.960
and tried to save me.

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:48.600
Thinking back now, it was so childish that it's embarrassing to recall.

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:56.220
But I think you and I were able to turn
those childhood feelings into memories.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:01.400
And now, a new love is born.

00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:05.880
As long as we're together, we'll always create more love.

00:22:07.970 --> 00:22:11.810
Because I really, really...

00:22:11.810 --> 00:22:14.200
love you.

00:23:50.890 --> 00:23:52.380
Sanehara Hikari.

00:23:52.380 --> 00:23:54.870
The sparkle that lies behind those cool eyes.

00:23:54.870 --> 00:23:56.860
She is dead set on taking still lifes.

00:23:56.860 --> 00:23:58.620
The scenery photographer of the Photo Club.

00:23:58.620 --> 00:24:02.250
Born on February 12th. Aquarius. Blood type B.

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:04.000
Height: below average.

00:24:04.000 --> 00:24:07.010
Wears black stockings with her uniform.

00:24:07.010 --> 00:24:10.420
Bust: large for a freshman.

00:24:10.420 --> 00:24:13.510
They say no one has ever seen her smile in the last six months.

00:24:13.510 --> 00:24:14.430
Go, Maeda!

00:24:14.430 --> 00:24:17.090
Go in shooting!

00:24:17.090 --> 00:24:18.830
Stealth smile.
